Three active terms exist for RAHEEM-25: 30, 60, and 90 days. The current set conflicts with the new allowed durations (30, 90, 180, 365, 730, and 1095 days). No existing stake rows were found in this snapshot, but any future migration must still preserve stakes that have accepted older terms.
